      "message": "fix(post): refuse undocumented Heidenhain Cartesian helices\n\nRefuse native XY helices by operation name. Reject Cartesian helices in the mirror reader and retain planar coverage. Pin both refusals and update the affected Heidenhain fixtures.\n\nFixes #2475",
